674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UD629JKvm4gQ7kNvwEEPRJS&_nc_oc=Adru5E02Nnx2Xm0aRRALDfz8iqVARgXtTiT6q2a4_0rYJWK_0j0yOlc8JrbsT6b3h5A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5siMBqroQaIWVOAggDlGH-0KnZe8-Z0V_hGjM6_sVACA&oe=6A15AED9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I0EGwm3jc5gQ7kNvwHFKfWi&_nc_oc=Adqst4vzpH7LceVk0ym5Rzvq3wVaWFCCt24zUBFqK5ofPpzhb0rU8YdEoEAqbH7iNSM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7wlD2mVoo31uLbl_Dwkxs3H3mlkwFu7VZLKcN1cqUTzw&oe=6A15B796"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oeI_rm-yzjwQ7kNvwEhyFUC&_nc_oc=AdpZP_bAOseczuGJ5jOgX3sJ5OB_TY_4TMOBOlKMYGASQ4mIb1KN626v5_RfJaV0kQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6YktRlQ6g4DSG3WGZUE73P2l6SDarn2GiRNQxhlgmoYA&oe=6A15B3B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip